INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "I find myself in a place with rolling plains and patches of forest. The temperature is mild with clear skies and a gentle breeze, which suggests that I am not immediately at risk from the environment. I notice scattered berry bushes and rabbits, which could be sources of food, and a small stream that could provide water. My current status shows some hunger and thirst, as well as a moderate level of energy. To address my immediate needs, I decide to first locate the stream and drink water to reduce my thirst level. Then, I will search for berries to eat, as they seem to be a readily accessible food source. This should help improve my energy and hunger levels. As my injury level is low, I believe I can forage for food and water without significant difficulty. Once my immediate needs are met, I will consider shelter options, possibly using sparse trees or small rock overhangs for protection during the night."
}

