INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Reflecting on my current situation, I notice that my hunger level is at 4 and thirst is at 2, which indicates I should prioritize finding food and water. My environment provides limited berry bushes, elusive rabbits, and wild herbs for food, and there's a small stream with steady water for my thirst. Given that my injury level is 2, I need to be cautious while moving around, but the overall danger level is low, which is reassuring. My sleep score is quite good at 10, and my energy is at 6, suggesting I am fairly rested. As a plan of action, I will head towards the stream to drink water and reduce my thirst level. Simultaneously, I will look for wild herbs and berry bushes to gather food, focusing on herbs since they seem less elusive compared to rabbits. I will explore the possibility of using the sparse trees and small rock overhangs as temporary shelter to rest if needed, considering the clear skies and gentle breeze which make the environment comfortable for exploration. After gathering food and water, I will reassess my situation, monitor my energy and health, and document any new observations or skills I acquire in my diary."
}

